        "created_at": "2013-11-14T18:58:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>3) Yes, I believe scenario 3 is correct. It also allows you to control redierctions to determine who gets the final effect, i.e. if Lead from the Front and Smoke Bombs are in play you could hold off on redirecting to Legacy until after Smoke Bombs has kicked in.</p><p>I'm mostly objecting to interefering with damage while it's still being calculated. I do not agree that redirection or prevention are simultaneous with modify damage totals. Without that, the question becomes moot.</p>",
