      {
        "id": 81801,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-15T00:08:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I see what you are getting at, but have you considered that Barron blades immunity granted by the MDP could alter your step 3?</p><p>consider that Nightmist can't redirect an instance of damage with amulet while she's immune to damage. I do not believe the order of operations trumps that ruling, so I consider it valid. If that's the case, I do not believe you would be able to redirect to Fanatic. I'd be interested on your thoughts on immunity.&nbsp;</p><p>But yes I think you might be able to wait on Twist the Ether. And no I think the redirection wouldn't be retroactively canceled. The trigger for the redirect is conditional sure, but the effect is not conditional (like MTC is a conditional effect).&nbsp;</p>",
