        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-24T05:17:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Here's a question that puzzled me today - under the OoO ruling, if Absolute Zero has the lowest HP and a Null-Point Calibration Unit in play, and Wraith has out Smoke Bombs, and a Gene-Bound Frost Hound deals cold damage to everything, can Absolute Zero choose to gain HP by taking the cold damage, instead of redirecting the damage away from himself to the highest-HP hero?</p>",
