      {
        "id": 81806,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-24T06:21:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Smoke Bombs is not optional, but the timing of Smoke Bombs and the conversion from cold to healing should be simultaneous, and that would mean hero choice.</p><p>I would say that since we have no reason to treat them as anything but simultaneous that the order would be your choice, so yes, AZ could heal before the redirection would trigger, causing the redirection to not trigger. &nbsp;</p>",
